Usage: berth worktree [options] [command]

manage registered worktrees

Options:
  -h, --help                     display help for command

Commands:
  list [options]                 list registered worktrees
  remove [options] [identifier]  remove a worktree's environment: containers,
                                 volumes, networks, images, home, and
                                 registration
  unlock [options] [identifier]  clear a dead holder's lock on a worktree, once
                                 the holder and every command it started on this
                                 machine are checked gone
  help [command]                 display help for command
